{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ecom-apis-collection",
    "name": "Ecommerce Microservices APIs",
    "description": "HTTP APIs for every service in this project.\n\n**How to use**\n1. Import this collection and `Ecommerce-Local.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Select the **Ecommerce Local** environment.\n3. Run **End-to-End Flow** first (creates a customer, then order), or hit services directly.\n\n**Service ports**\n- Gateway: 8222\n- Config server: 8888\n- Discovery (Eureka): 8761\n- Customer: 8090 (`/api/v1/customer`)\n- Product: 8050 (`/api/v1/products`)\n- Order: 8070 (`/api/v1/orders`, `/api/v1/order-lines`)\n- Payment: 8060 (`/api/v1/payments`)\n- Notification: Kafka consumer only — no REST API\n\n**Gateway notes**\n- Customer controller is singular (`/api/v1/customer`) but the gateway route is `/api/v1/customers/**`.\n- Order-lines gateway route currently points at CUSTOMER-SERVICE.\n- Discovery locator is enabled, so `/customer-service/...` style paths may also work.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "gatewayUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8222" },
    { "key": "configUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8888" },
    { "key": "discoveryUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8761" },
    { "key": "customerUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8090" },
    { "key": "productUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8050" },
    { "key": "orderUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8070" },
    { "key": "paymentUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8060" },
    { "key": "customerId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "orderReference", "value": "ORD-001" }
  ],
